{"id":"vol8-01","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-01/audio-2.m4a","model":"small","duration":355.27,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":8.06,"text":"You will hear the manager of a bookshop called Bibliostack, talking to a group of young people","words":[["You",0.0,1.08],["will",1.08,2.18],["hear",2.18,2.4],["the",2.4,2.58],["manager",2.58,3.0],["of",3.0,3.28],["a",3.28,3.4],["bookshop",3.4,4.0],["called",4.0,4.56],["Bibliostack,",4.56,5.68],["talking",6.18,6.56],["to",6.56,6.82],["a",6.82,6.98],["group",6.98,7.22],["of",7.22,7.46],["young",7.46,7.68],["people",7.68,8.06]]},{"start":8.06,"end":10.4,"text":"about the way the bookshop is organised.","words":[["about",8.06,8.54],["the",8.54,8.78],["way",8.78,8.96],["the",8.96,9.12],["bookshop",9.12,9.6],["is",9.6,9.84],["organised.",9.84,10.4]]},{"start":11.8,"end":15.86,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 15.","words":[["First,",11.8,12.3],["you",12.7,12.82],["have",12.82,12.96],["some",12.96,13.14],["time",13.14,13.46],["to",13.46,13.64],["look",13.64,13.82],["at",13.82,14.02],["questions",14.02,14.28],["11",14.28,14.96],["to",14.96,15.38],["15.",15.38,15.86]]},{"start":41.27,"end":45.49,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 15.","words":[["Now",41.27,41.61],["listen",41.61,41.93],["carefully",41.93,42.39],["and",42.39,42.97],["answer",42.97,43.37],["questions",43.37,43.83],["11",43.83,44.49],["to",44.49,45.03],["15.",45.03,45.49]]},{"start":49.17,"end":52.93,"text":"Good morning everyone and a big welcome to Bibliostack.","words":[["Good",49.17,49.61],["morning",49.61,49.87],["everyone",49.87,50.25],["and",50.25,50.85],["a",50.85,51.03],["big",51.03,51.21],["welcome",51.21,51.57],["to",51.57,51.95],["Bibliostack.",51.95,52.93]]},{"start":53.51,"end":56.57,"text":"Firstly I'll explain the plan of the store to you.","words":[["Firstly",53.51,54.03],["I'll",54.03,54.51],["explain",54.51,54.85],["the",54.85,55.19],["plan",55.19,55.51],["of",55.51,55.63],["the",55.63,55.75],["store",55.75,56.07],["to",56.07,56.31],["you.",56.31,56.57]]},{"start":56.57,"end":62.35,"text":"The building is on seven floors and is circular, as you can see, and we're here","words":[["The",56.57,57.31],["building",57.31,57.67],["is",57.67,58.15],["on",58.15,58.29],["seven",58.29,58.71],["floors",58.71,59.15],["and",59.15,59.73],["is",59.73,59.97],["circular,",59.97,60.45],["as",60.79,60.91],["you",60.91,61.01],["can",61.01,61.13],["see,",61.13,61.37],["and",61.69,61.91],["we're",61.91,62.13],["here",62.13,62.35]]},{"start":62.35,"end":67.95,"text":"on the ground floor in its entrance hall. Right in the centre of this floor, but","words":[["on",62.35,62.59],["the",62.59,62.71],["ground",62.71,63.03],["floor",63.03,63.41],["in",63.41,63.87],["its",63.87,64.01],["entrance",64.01,64.41],["hall.",64.41,64.79],["Right",65.61,65.91],["in",65.91,66.09],["the",66.09,66.21],["centre",66.21,66.59],["of",66.59,66.85],["this",66.85,67.01],["floor,",67.01,67.35],["but",67.71,67.95]]},{"start":67.95,"end":71.87,"text":"behind the bookshelf, so you can't see it very well from here, is our main seating","words":[["behind",67.95,68.27],["the",68.27,68.45],["bookshelf,",68.45,68.83],["so",68.95,69.07],["you",69.07,69.21],["can't",69.21,69.45],["see",69.45,69.59],["it",69.59,69.67],["very",69.67,69.85],["well",69.85,70.05],["from",70.05,70.19],["here,",70.19,70.43],["is",70.69,70.93],["our",70.93,71.11],["main",71.11,71.51],["seating",71.51,71.87]]},{"start":71.87,"end":77.05,"text":"area where people are encouraged to sit and read for as long as they like. But","words":[["area",71.87,72.29],["where",72.29,72.73],["people",72.73,73.07],["are",73.07,73.39],["encouraged",73.39,73.75],["to",73.75,74.03],["sit",74.03,74.31],["and",74.31,74.63],["read",74.63,74.97],["for",74.97,75.47],["as",75.47,75.59],["long",75.59,75.79],["as",75.79,75.93],["they",75.93,76.03],["like.",76.03,76.33],["But",76.53,77.05]]},{"start":77.05,"end":80.15,"text":"they're under no pressure to buy what they're reading, that's not how we","words":[["they're",77.05,77.21],["under",77.21,77.33],["no",77.33,77.57],["pressure",77.57,77.85],["to",77.85,78.03],["buy",78.03,78.29],["what",78.29,78.49],["they're",78.49,78.69],["reading,",78.69,78.89],["that's",79.31,79.63],["not",79.63,79.75],["how",79.75,80.01],["we",80.01,80.15]]},{"start":80.15,"end":84.75,"text":"operate. And if you look to your immediate left past the first double row","words":[["operate.",80.15,80.49],["And",81.09,81.35],["if",81.35,81.47],["you",81.47,81.59],["look",81.59,81.75],["to",81.75,81.93],["your",81.93,82.13],["immediate",82.13,82.59],["left",82.59,83.15],["past",83.15,83.61],["the",83.61,83.89],["first",83.89,84.19],["double",84.19,84.45],["row",84.45,84.75]]},{"start":84.75,"end":90.83,"text":"shelves you'll see piles of coloured cushions in front of the window there. We provide those so that","words":[["shelves",84.75,85.13],["you'll",85.13,85.85],["see",85.85,86.07],["piles",86.07,86.53],["of",86.53,86.77],["coloured",86.77,87.13],["cushions",87.13,87.69],["in",87.69,87.85],["front",87.85,87.99],["of",87.99,88.13],["the",88.13,88.23],["window",88.23,88.45],["there.",88.45,88.79],["We",89.37,89.53],["provide",89.53,89.85],["those",89.85,90.25],["so",90.25,90.65],["that",90.65,90.83]]},{"start":90.83,"end":95.83,"text":"people can sit wherever they want. Lots of people like to sit close to the bookshelves and if they","words":[["people",90.83,91.07],["can",91.07,91.33],["sit",91.33,91.55],["wherever",91.55,91.81],["they",91.81,92.05],["want.",92.05,92.27],["Lots",92.91,93.05],["of",93.05,93.19],["people",93.19,93.35],["like",93.35,93.63],["to",93.63,93.79],["sit",93.79,93.91],["close",93.91,94.23],["to",94.23,94.41],["the",94.41,94.53],["bookshelves",94.53,95.09],["and",95.09,95.59],["if",95.59,95.71],["they",95.71,95.83]]},{"start":95.83,"end":100.43,"text":"want to sit on the floor there we want them to be as comfortable as possible. On your right","words":[["want",95.83,95.99],["to",95.99,96.13],["sit",96.13,96.25],["on",96.25,96.39],["the",96.39,96.47],["floor",96.47,96.71],["there",96.71,96.97],["we",96.97,97.33],["want",97.33,97.49],["them",97.49,97.59],["to",97.59,97.69],["be",97.69,97.81],["as",97.81,97.93],["comfortable",97.93,98.25],["as",98.25,98.47],["possible.",98.47,98.81],["On",99.75,100.05],["your",100.05,100.19],["right",100.19,100.43]]},{"start":100.43,"end":105.91,"text":"between the two larger bookshelves you'll see the computer bench where our visitors can search","words":[["between",100.43,100.83],["the",100.83,101.15],["two",101.15,101.45],["larger",101.45,101.81],["bookshelves",101.81,102.49],["you'll",102.49,103.01],["see",103.01,103.23],["the",103.23,103.47],["computer",103.47,103.93],["bench",103.93,104.21],["where",104.21,104.91],["our",104.91,105.05],["visitors",105.05,105.29],["can",105.29,105.63],["search",105.63,105.91]]},{"start":105.91,"end":111.29,"text":"through our entire catalogue. We pride ourselves in being the largest bookshop in the country","words":[["through",105.91,106.23],["our",106.23,106.51],["entire",106.51,106.97],["catalogue.",106.97,107.61],["We",107.99,108.25],["pride",108.25,108.57],["ourselves",108.57,108.97],["in",108.97,109.35],["being",109.35,109.59],["the",109.59,109.79],["largest",109.79,110.21],["bookshop",110.21,110.67],["in",110.67,110.83],["the",110.83,110.91],["country",110.91,111.29]]},{"start":111.29,"end":115.11,"text":"entry, so our sales assistants can't possibly know all the available titles.","words":[["entry,",111.29,111.39],["so",111.71,111.97],["our",111.97,112.25],["sales",112.25,112.55],["assistants",112.55,112.97],["can't",112.97,113.65],["possibly",113.65,114.01],["know",114.01,114.15],["all",114.15,114.35],["the",114.35,114.43],["available",114.43,114.73],["titles.",114.73,115.11]]},{"start":116.91,"end":121.61,"text":"Although the room in front of you is dominated by the bookshelves, at the far end, just in","words":[["Although",116.91,117.35],["the",117.35,117.55],["room",117.55,117.65],["in",117.65,117.77],["front",117.77,117.93],["of",117.93,118.07],["you",118.07,118.19],["is",118.19,118.31],["dominated",118.31,118.67],["by",118.67,119.05],["the",119.05,119.19],["bookshelves,",119.19,119.87],["at",120.21,120.41],["the",120.41,120.51],["far",120.51,120.85],["end,",120.85,121.19],["just",121.33,121.43],["in",121.43,121.61]]},{"start":121.61,"end":125.63,"text":"front of the lift, you'll see that we provide a small cafe bar here too.","words":[["front",121.61,121.75],["of",121.75,121.91],["the",121.91,122.01],["lift,",122.01,122.23],["you'll",122.55,122.75],["see",122.75,122.93],["that",122.93,123.07],["we",123.07,123.19],["provide",123.19,123.49],["a",123.49,123.79],["small",123.79,124.11],["cafe",124.11,124.61],["bar",124.61,125.09],["here",125.09,125.33],["too.",125.33,125.63]]},{"start":126.35,"end":130.03,"text":"And just to your right, there's a door to the cloakroom, where people can leave their","words":[["And",126.35,126.63],["just",126.63,126.83],["to",126.83,127.03],["your",127.03,127.17],["right,",127.17,127.47],["there's",127.61,127.83],["a",127.83,127.95],["door",127.95,128.15],["to",128.15,128.29],["the",128.29,128.41],["cloakroom,",128.41,128.87],["where",129.03,129.21],["people",129.21,129.43],["can",129.43,129.61],["leave",129.61,129.81],["their",129.81,130.03]]},{"start":130.03,"end":130.29,"text":"coats.","words":[["coats.",130.03,130.29]]},{"start":131.17,"end":135.71,"text":"Then after that, there's a stand where we keep a selection of local and national","words":[["Then",131.17,131.35],["after",131.35,131.57],["that,",131.57,131.85],["there's",132.29,132.67],["a",132.67,132.83],["stand",132.83,133.17],["where",133.17,133.45],["we",133.45,133.59],["keep",133.59,133.71],["a",133.71,133.85],["selection",133.85,134.13],["of",134.13,134.39],["local",134.39,134.73],["and",134.73,135.17],["national",135.17,135.71]]},{"start":135.71,"end":136.23,"text":"newspapers.","words":[["newspapers.",135.71,136.23]]},{"start":136.89,"end":140.29,"text":"Customers are welcome to browse through them, and we also have some for sale.","words":[["Customers",136.89,137.33],["are",137.33,137.43],["welcome",137.43,137.63],["to",137.63,137.83],["browse",137.83,138.11],["through",138.11,138.39],["them,",138.39,138.57],["and",138.79,139.13],["we",139.13,139.29],["also",139.29,139.49],["have",139.49,139.69],["some",139.69,139.87],["for",139.87,140.05],["sale.",140.05,140.29]]},{"start":140.29,"end":146.01,"text":"We really want people to feel as though they're browsing through books in the comfort of their own home.","words":[["We",140.29,141.21],["really",141.21,141.59],["want",141.59,141.83],["people",141.83,142.07],["to",142.07,142.25],["feel",142.25,142.51],["as",142.51,142.77],["though",142.77,142.95],["they're",142.95,143.21],["browsing",143.21,143.57],["through",143.57,143.83],["books",143.83,144.17],["in",144.17,144.65],["the",144.65,144.77],["comfort",144.77,145.09],["of",145.09,145.31],["their",145.31,145.45],["own",145.45,145.65],["home.",145.65,146.01]]},{"start":149.77,"end":155.37,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 16 to 20.","words":[["Before",149.77,150.09],["you",150.09,150.37],["hear",150.37,150.63],["the",150.63,150.79],["rest",150.79,151.01],["of",151.01,151.15],["the",151.15,151.27],["talk,",151.27,151.59],["you",152.01,152.17],["have",152.17,152.31],["some",152.31,152.49],["time",152.49,152.77],["to",152.77,152.95],["look",152.95,153.15],["at",153.15,153.35],["questions",153.35,153.65],["16",153.65,154.45],["to",154.45,154.91],["20.",154.91,155.37]]},{"start":190.63,"end":194.31,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 16 to 20.","words":[["Now",190.63,190.95],["listen",190.95,191.31],["and",191.31,191.73],["answer",191.73,192.19],["questions",192.19,192.53],["16",192.53,193.41],["to",193.41,193.89],["20.",193.89,194.31]]},{"start":197.84,"end":203.58,"text":"Right. Now I suggest we walk slowly up through the building and I'll give you more information as we go.","words":[["Right.",197.84,198.36],["Now",198.68,198.84],["I",198.84,199.1],["suggest",199.1,199.34],["we",199.34,199.62],["walk",199.62,199.82],["slowly",199.82,200.32],["up",200.32,200.66],["through",200.66,200.9],["the",200.9,201.04],["building",201.04,201.32],["and",201.32,201.9],["I'll",201.9,202.08],["give",202.08,202.2],["you",202.2,202.38],["more",202.38,202.58],["information",202.58,203.0],["as",203.0,203.28],["we",203.28,203.4],["go.",203.4,203.58]]},{"start":204.34,"end":206.04,"text":"We're open 12 hours a day.","words":[["We're",204.34,204.54],["open",204.54,204.74],["12",204.74,205.16],["hours",205.16,205.6],["a",205.6,205.78],["day.",205.78,206.04]]},{"start":206.46,"end":210.02,"text":"We don't mind if people spend the whole day here, but leave without buying anything.","words":[["We",206.46,206.66],["don't",206.66,206.8],["mind",206.8,206.98],["if",206.98,207.1],["people",207.1,207.3],["spend",207.3,207.56],["the",207.56,207.74],["whole",207.74,208.08],["day",208.08,208.3],["here,",208.3,208.64],["but",208.84,209.02],["leave",209.02,209.2],["without",209.2,209.46],["buying",209.46,209.7],["anything.",209.7,210.02]]},{"start":210.02,"end":215.38,"text":"Of course, we hope they'll buy something, but our purpose is to draw people in, to provide","words":[["Of",210.02,210.72],["course,",210.72,210.94],["we",211.02,211.18],["hope",211.18,211.52],["they'll",211.52,211.72],["buy",211.72,211.88],["something,",211.88,212.24],["but",212.52,212.76],["our",212.76,212.9],["purpose",212.9,213.18],["is",213.18,213.46],["to",213.46,213.62],["draw",213.62,214.0],["people",214.0,214.36],["in,",214.36,214.64],["to",214.84,215.1],["provide",215.1,215.38]]},{"start":215.38,"end":218.58,"text":"the kind of environment which makes them want to stay and read.","words":[["the",215.38,215.58],["kind",215.58,215.84],["of",215.84,216.04],["environment",216.04,216.54],["which",216.54,216.88],["makes",216.88,217.12],["them",217.12,217.3],["want",217.3,217.48],["to",217.48,217.66],["stay",217.66,218.02],["and",218.02,218.28],["read.",218.28,218.58]]},{"start":219.44,"end":222.0,"text":"Look at how busy each floor is, but how quiet.","words":[["Look",219.44,219.6],["at",219.6,219.7],["how",219.7,219.88],["busy",219.88,220.2],["each",220.2,220.46],["floor",220.46,220.66],["is,",220.66,220.92],["but",221.12,221.28],["how",221.28,221.5],["quiet.",221.5,222.0]]},{"start":223.36,"end":226.44,"text":"You may be wondering whether there are any children in the building.","words":[["You",223.36,223.66],["may",223.66,223.84],["be",223.84,223.98],["wondering",223.98,224.36],["whether",224.36,224.76],["there",224.76,224.96],["are",224.96,225.1],["any",225.1,225.34],["children",225.34,225.74],["in",225.74,226.12],["the",226.12,226.2],["building.",226.2,226.44]]},{"start":227.04,"end":231.34,"text":"We debated about locating children's books on the ground floor, or halfway up the","words":[["We",227.04,227.28],["debated",227.28,227.62],["about",227.62,227.88],["locating",227.88,228.38],["children's",228.38,228.88],["books",228.88,229.08],["on",229.08,229.4],["the",229.4,229.52],["ground",229.52,229.8],["floor,",229.8,230.14],["or",230.48,230.7],["halfway",230.7,231.0],["up",231.0,231.24],["the",231.24,231.34]]},{"start":231.34,"end":235.5,"text":"building like the third or fourth floor, but in the end, we decided to put them on","words":[["building",231.34,231.6],["like",231.6,231.86],["the",231.86,232.06],["third",232.06,232.34],["or",232.34,232.48],["fourth",232.48,232.78],["floor,",232.78,233.08],["but",233.52,233.76],["in",233.76,233.86],["the",233.86,233.98],["end,",233.98,234.18],["we",234.24,234.42],["decided",234.42,234.74],["to",234.74,234.94],["put",234.94,235.06],["them",235.06,235.24],["on",235.24,235.5]]},{"start":235.5,"end":236.34,"text":"the very top level.","words":[["the",235.5,235.62],["very",235.62,235.8],["top",235.8,236.08],["level.",236.08,236.34]]},{"start":236.34,"end":241.7,"text":"and I can assure you it's not the least bit quiet up there. Of course many parents would","words":[["and",236.34,236.8],["I",236.8,236.94],["can",236.94,237.1],["assure",237.1,237.42],["you",237.42,237.72],["it's",237.72,238.14],["not",238.14,238.3],["the",238.3,238.5],["least",238.5,238.72],["bit",238.72,238.9],["quiet",238.9,239.14],["up",239.14,239.38],["there.",239.38,239.64],["Of",240.38,240.5],["course",240.5,240.74],["many",240.74,241.0],["parents",241.0,241.4],["would",241.4,241.7]]},{"start":241.7,"end":246.76,"text":"prefer to spend time on other floors and so we provide a supervised area for children under","words":[["prefer",241.7,242.02],["to",242.02,242.24],["spend",242.24,242.4],["time",242.4,242.78],["on",242.78,243.04],["other",243.04,243.24],["floors",243.24,243.54],["and",243.54,243.92],["so",243.92,244.18],["we",244.18,244.32],["provide",244.32,244.66],["a",244.66,244.84],["supervised",244.84,245.16],["area",245.16,245.72],["for",245.72,246.06],["children",246.06,246.44],["under",246.44,246.76]]},{"start":246.76,"end":252.32,"text":"two in the basement so parents can wander around the shop for a few hours and not worry.","words":[["two",246.76,247.16],["in",247.16,247.72],["the",247.72,247.84],["basement",247.84,248.24],["so",248.24,248.98],["parents",248.98,249.36],["can",249.36,249.64],["wander",249.64,249.94],["around",249.94,250.32],["the",250.32,250.46],["shop",250.46,250.72],["for",250.72,250.9],["a",250.9,251.04],["few",251.04,251.16],["hours",251.16,251.48],["and",251.48,251.88],["not",251.88,252.04],["worry.",252.04,252.32]]},{"start":252.78,"end":256.96,"text":"But they do have to pay for this service because although we thought about using some","words":[["But",252.78,253.12],["they",253.12,253.24],["do",253.24,253.36],["have",253.36,253.52],["to",253.52,253.62],["pay",253.62,253.92],["for",253.92,254.12],["this",254.12,254.28],["service",254.28,254.68],["because",254.68,255.3],["although",255.3,255.78],["we",255.78,256.06],["thought",256.06,256.26],["about",256.26,256.48],["using",256.48,256.72],["some",256.72,256.96]]},{"start":256.96,"end":261.96,"text":"of our own assistants we decided to employ qualified nursery staff for parents complete","words":[["of",256.96,257.12],["our",257.12,257.24],["own",257.24,257.4],["assistants",257.4,257.7],["we",257.7,258.3],["decided",258.3,258.6],["to",258.6,258.8],["employ",258.8,259.1],["qualified",259.1,259.72],["nursery",259.72,260.16],["staff",260.16,260.64],["for",260.64,261.08],["parents",261.08,261.4],["complete",261.4,261.96]]},{"start":261.96,"end":267.14,"text":"peace of mind. Now we're just passing the fiction section and you've probably","words":[["peace",261.96,262.28],["of",262.28,262.48],["mind.",262.48,262.74],["Now",263.78,264.24],["we're",264.24,264.46],["just",264.46,264.62],["passing",264.62,265.0],["the",265.0,265.26],["fiction",265.26,265.58],["section",265.58,266.0],["and",266.0,266.58],["you've",266.58,266.88],["probably",266.88,267.14]]},{"start":267.14,"end":271.18,"text":"noticed a small crowd of people beginning to gather. That's because a well-known","words":[["noticed",267.14,267.5],["a",267.5,267.72],["small",267.72,268.0],["crowd",268.0,268.38],["of",268.38,268.52],["people",268.52,268.82],["beginning",268.82,269.16],["to",269.16,269.38],["gather.",269.38,269.6],["That's",270.14,270.48],["because",270.48,270.64],["a",270.64,270.82],["well",270.82,271.0],["-known",271.0,271.18]]},{"start":271.18,"end":275.46,"text":"author is going to read from her latest novel. We try to hold events like this","words":[["author",271.18,271.54],["is",271.54,271.8],["going",271.8,271.96],["to",271.96,272.14],["read",272.14,272.4],["from",272.4,272.6],["her",272.6,272.78],["latest",272.78,273.14],["novel.",273.14,273.52],["We",274.1,274.26],["try",274.26,274.44],["to",274.44,274.56],["hold",274.56,274.76],["events",274.76,275.02],["like",275.02,275.26],["this",275.26,275.46]]},{"start":275.46,"end":279.9,"text":"at least once or twice a week and as you can imagine they're very popular. We","words":[["at",275.46,275.6],["least",275.6,275.74],["once",275.74,276.06],["or",276.06,276.24],["twice",276.24,276.5],["a",276.5,276.72],["week",276.72,276.94],["and",276.94,277.54],["as",277.54,277.7],["you",277.7,277.8],["can",277.8,277.9],["imagine",277.9,278.18],["they're",278.18,278.46],["very",278.46,278.72],["popular.",278.72,279.16],["We",279.68,279.9]]},{"start":279.9,"end":283.7,"text":"don't make a charge for people to attend but we obviously hope that some of them","words":[["don't",279.9,280.08],["make",280.08,280.26],["a",280.26,280.38],["charge",280.38,280.76],["for",280.76,281.0],["people",281.0,281.22],["to",281.22,281.38],["attend",281.38,281.7],["but",281.7,282.38],["we",282.38,282.54],["obviously",282.54,282.8],["hope",282.8,283.1],["that",283.1,283.26],["some",283.26,283.46],["of",283.46,283.6],["them",283.6,283.7]]},{"start":283.7,"end":286.68,"text":"will want to purchase the book after listening to part of it being read","words":[["will",283.7,283.84],["want",283.84,284.0],["to",284.0,284.14],["purchase",284.14,284.44],["the",284.44,284.68],["book",284.68,284.9],["after",284.9,285.26],["listening",285.26,285.6],["to",285.6,285.88],["part",285.88,286.12],["of",286.12,286.26],["it",286.26,286.34],["being",286.34,286.52],["read",286.52,286.68]]},{"start":286.68,"end":290.58,"text":"aloud. Other events which are proving to be very popular are our","words":[["aloud.",286.68,287.0],["Other",287.6,287.78],["events",287.78,288.08],["which",288.08,288.4],["are",288.4,288.6],["proving",288.6,288.88],["to",288.88,289.06],["be",289.06,289.18],["very",289.18,289.38],["popular",289.38,289.8],["are",289.8,290.38],["our",290.38,290.58]]},{"start":290.58,"end":295.6,"text":"workshops. Last week we held a poetry workshop and people came along with poems","words":[["workshops.",290.58,291.0],["Last",291.76,292.0],["week",292.0,292.3],["we",292.3,292.5],["held",292.5,292.74],["a",292.74,292.88],["poetry",292.88,293.16],["workshop",293.16,293.68],["and",293.68,294.16],["people",294.16,294.46],["came",294.46,294.68],["along",294.68,294.94],["with",294.94,295.22],["poems",295.22,295.6]]},{"start":295.6,"end":299.28,"text":"that they'd written. One of the country's best-known poets ran the workshop","words":[["that",295.6,295.88],["they'd",295.88,296.1],["written.",296.1,296.34],["One",296.92,297.06],["of",297.06,297.16],["the",297.16,297.26],["country's",297.26,297.66],["best",297.66,297.88],["-known",297.88,298.14],["poets",298.14,298.54],["ran",298.54,298.82],["the",298.82,298.94],["workshop",298.94,299.28]]},{"start":299.28,"end":303.78,"text":"and the participants read their poems aloud to him. He was kind and","words":[["and",299.28,299.98],["the",299.98,300.12],["participants",300.12,300.54],["read",300.54,301.0],["their",301.0,301.2],["poems",301.2,301.5],["aloud",301.5,301.78],["to",301.78,302.0],["him.",302.0,302.12],["He",302.78,302.9],["was",302.9,303.02],["kind",303.02,303.42],["and",303.42,303.78]]},{"start":303.78,"end":308.34,"text":"encouraging and many people felt inspired by his advice. It's extremely","words":[["encouraging",303.78,304.16],["and",304.16,304.7],["many",304.7,305.12],["people",305.12,305.36],["felt",305.36,305.56],["inspired",305.56,306.22],["by",306.22,306.54],["his",306.54,306.76],["advice.",306.76,307.12],["It's",307.68,307.86],["extremely",307.86,308.34]]},{"start":308.34,"end":311.86,"text":"difficult to own your living as a professional poet and even published","words":[["difficult",308.34,308.8],["to",308.8,309.12],["own",309.12,309.34],["your",309.34,309.46],["living",309.46,309.66],["as",309.66,310.0],["a",310.0,310.12],["professional",310.12,310.44],["poet",310.44,310.9],["and",310.9,311.28],["even",311.28,311.48],["published",311.48,311.86]]},{"start":311.86,"end":316.66,"text":"poets have other jobs. Now we're going to take a look at our section on","words":[["poets",311.86,312.24],["have",312.24,312.68],["other",312.68,312.88],["jobs.",312.88,313.2],["Now",314.28,314.66],["we're",314.66,314.82],["going",314.82,314.94],["to",314.94,315.06],["take",315.06,315.24],["a",315.24,315.38],["look",315.38,315.52],["at",315.52,315.82],["our",315.82,315.98],["section",315.98,316.26],["on",316.26,316.66]]},{"start":320.52,"end":327.68,"text":"That is the end of part two. You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to part two.","words":[["That",320.52,321.12],["is",321.12,321.4],["the",321.4,321.58],["end",321.58,321.84],["of",321.84,322.0],["part",322.0,322.26],["two.",322.26,322.7],["You",323.56,323.84],["now",323.84,324.14],["have",324.14,324.44],["30",324.44,324.92],["seconds",324.92,325.38],["to",325.38,325.74],["check",325.74,325.98],["your",325.98,326.24],["answers",326.24,326.64],["to",326.64,326.96],["part",326.96,327.24],["two.",327.24,327.68]]}]}